%% title: Which admission sections the website shows
%% desc: The Admissions section lists rounds that are open today, or rounds with Always show on the website ticked. Check admission result and Admission lists show only when switched on in the site editor, and need a published result.
flowchart LR
  R["Admission round<br/>dates, Always show"] --> A["Admissions section<br/>Apply button"]
  E["Site editor: Pages → Admissions<br/>switch sections on or off"] --> A
  E --> X["Check admission result"]
  E --> L["Admission lists"]
  P["Published result"] --> X
  P --> L
  classDef done fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef stop fill:#fff5f5,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c1111
